# Frame Zero working artifacts — durable on disk, OUT of git (heavy / regenerable).
# The film is made entirely inside higgsfield/ (never /tmp). Canonical script and
# code below are tracked; everything a render or a cut produces is ignored.
clips/
videos/
frames/
*.mp4
*.png
.stage
pipeline_state.json

# tracked (do NOT ignore): frame_zero_v2.json (the script), frame-zero-script.md,
# *.py, *.md, frame-zero-v2-seer-doctrine.pdf, .gitignore
!.gitignore
